          <h2 id="objective-title">Objective</h2>
          <p>I am an experimental physicist turned software developer with over 15 years of experience developing and managing cutting-edge tech projects. I care about making complex technology approachable, building welcoming communities, and making quantum technology more accessible.</p>
          <p>While not from Seattle originally, I have found my home here. I enjoy <a href="/books/">writing books</a> about cool technologies on a split ergo keyboard, cutting things with lasers, and playing with my pup Chewie.</p>
